{'symbol': 'SO', 'date': '2021-09-07 13:56:00', 'title': 'GEORGIA POWER NAMED A TOP U.S. UTILITY FOR ECONOMIC DEVELOPMENT', 'text': 'ATLANTA, SEPT. 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0FOR THE 23RD CONSECUTIVE YEAR,\xa0GEORGIA POWER HAS BEEN NAMED A "TOP U.S. UTILITY FOR ECONOMIC DEVELOPMENT" BY SITE SELECTION MAGAZINE.'}{'symbol': 'SO', 'date': '2021-09-07 10:38:00', 'title': 'GEORGIA AQUARIUM TO REDUCE EMISSIONS FOOTPRINT WITH GREENER LIFE® FOR BUSINESS FROM GEORGIA NATURAL GAS', 'text': "ATLANTA, SEPT. 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0GEORGIA NATURAL GAS (GNG), GEORGIA'S LEADING NATURAL GAS PROVIDER, AND GEORGIA AQUARIUM TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE AQUARIUM IS THE FIRST ORGANIZATION TO TAKE ADVANTAGE OF GREENER LIFE® FOR BUSINESS, A NEW SERVICE FROM GNG THAT PURCHASES CARBON OFFSETS ON BEHALF OF GNG'S COMMERCIAL CUSTOMERS TO MAKE EMISSIONS FROM THEIR NATURAL GAS USE CARBON NEUTRAL."}